    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my husband had the flu last week and seems to be getting a bit worse again. he's got a really high fever like 103 and a killer headache. he's acting a little bit weird and slow when he talks but i think it's probably just the fever making him loopy. should i just give him some more tylenol or should we head to the er?",
